  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "&quot;Huang Jin Tai Yang&quot; is a role-playing game for the Famicom. It is a Chinese port of the Game Boy Advance game &quot;Golden Sun.&quot; Players follow a protagonist on a quest to find the legendary Golden Sun, navigating through various levels filled with enemies and obstacles. The gameplay includes turn-based combat, puzzle-solving, and character development. Players explore different environments, collect items, and defeat enemies to progress through the game. There are hidden areas and secrets that players can uncover during their journey. As players advance, they face different challenges requiring strategic use of their abilities and collected items. The objective is to navigate through all the levels, overcome challenges, and discover the secrets of the Golden Sun."
    }
  ],
